{"seq":1,"slug":"aggregation-formation","title":"聚集与编队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/aggregation-formation","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"聚集与编队\">聚集与编队</h1><p>让散布在场地各处的机器人先聚成一团，再排成一个精确的六边形晶格——这两件事看似一前一后，其实代表了群体几何控制的两端：一端是松散的「凑到一起」（聚集），不在乎谁站哪里；另一端是严格的「站到指定位置」（编队），每台机器人在阵型里都有确定坐标。本篇把这两类最基础的空间协调算法讲透：聚集如何用最朴素的局部规则实现，编队如何用势场、位置约束与虚拟结构三种范式把群体钉成形状。它建立在 <a href=\"../coordination/distributed-coordination\">分布式协调机制</a> 的图论与邻域更新骨架之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从无序到有形的两个层级\">核心概念：从无序到有形的两个层级</h2><p>聚集与编队的差别，本质是「约束的强度」。聚集只要求空间上靠拢，是几乎所有更复杂集体行为的前置步骤——不先聚到能互相通信的范围，后面的协调都谈不上。编队则在聚集之上加了精确的相对位置约束。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>聚集（aggregation）</th>\n<th>编队（formation）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>个体聚到一处/一区域</td>\n<td>个体排成指定几何形状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置约束</td>\n<td>无（谁在哪都行）</td>\n<td>强（每个槽位有坐标）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息需求</td>\n<td>仅邻居相对方向/距离</td>\n<td>相对位置，常需共同参照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鲁棒性</td>\n<td>极高，丢个体无碍</td>\n<td>较低，缺位需重排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>集结、待命、增密通信</td>\n<td>协同搬运、传感器阵列、空中表演</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[随机散布] --&gt; B[聚集:局部吸引&lt;br/&gt;凑到通信范围内]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否需要精确形状?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[松散集群:待命/巡逻]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[编队]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[势场法]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[位置/位移约束]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[虚拟结构]&#10;  E1 --&gt; F[稳定几何阵型]&#10;  E2 --&gt; F&#10;  E3 --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[随机散布] --&gt; B[聚集:局部吸引&lt;br/&gt;凑到通信范围内]\n  B --&gt; C{是否需要精确形状?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[松散集群:待命/巡逻]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[编队]\n  E --&gt; E1[势场法]\n  E --&gt; E2[位置/位移约束]\n  E --&gt; E3[虚拟结构]\n  E1 --&gt; F[稳定几何阵型]\n  E2 --&gt; F\n  E3 --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"聚集-最朴素的吸引规则\">聚集：最朴素的吸引规则</h2><p>聚集是群体最基本的能力，经典实现简单到只有一条规则：朝感知到的邻居方向缓慢移动，没有邻居时随机游走直到撞见一个。在只有近距探测、无法测距的极简机器人（如早期 Kilobot）上，甚至连方向都不需要——用「检测到邻居就停、检测不到就转」的概率有限状态机，群体也能涌现出稳定的聚团，这就是著名的 BEECLUST 类算法。</p>\n<p>聚集的难点不在「聚」而在「聚得稳、聚得匀」：纯吸引会让群体塌缩成一个危险的点堆，因此必须叠加近距排斥，形成「远吸近斥」的平衡，使群体稳定在一个有限密度的团。这个「吸引-排斥」的二象性是后续编队与蜂拥共用的底层模式，其在运动协调中的版本见 <a href=\"flocking-collision-avoidance\">蜂拥与避碰</a>。聚集的价值在于它是 <a href=\"../foundations/bio-inspired-self-organization\">生物启发与自组织</a> 四要素中正反馈的最干净体现——越多个体聚在一起，越能吸引更多个体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编队范式一-人工势场\">编队范式一：人工势场</h2><p>把群体钉成精确形状，最主流的范式是人工势场（artificial potential field）。思路是给每台机器人设计一个势能函数，目标位置是势能谷底，障碍与过近的同伴是势能峰，机器人顺着负梯度运动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{u}_i = -\\nabla_i \\left( U_i^{att} + U_i^{rep} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中吸引势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U^{att}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把个体拉向它在阵型中的期望相对位置，排斥势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U^{rep}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 推开过近的邻居与障碍。一个常用的对势函数让任意两个邻居间稳定在期望间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{ij} = \\frac{1}{2}k\\,(\\|\\vec{p}_i - \\vec{p}_j\\| - d)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>势场法的优点是完全去中心化、计算极轻、天然把避障和成形统一在一个梯度里；缺点是经典局部极小值问题——机器人可能卡在非目标的势能谷里。2025 年的去中心化势场框架通过把轨迹跟踪、编队与避障统一进一个自组织控制器，并引入动态虚拟力来缓解局部极小（<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2218-6581/14/12/192\">Decentralized potential-field self-organizing control, MDPI 2025</a>；<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2073-8994/17/8/1202\">Dynamic virtual force coverage, MDPI 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编队范式二与三-位置约束与虚拟结构\">编队范式二与三：位置约束与虚拟结构</h2><p>势场之外还有两类编队范式，各有取舍。</p>\n<p><strong>基于约束的编队</strong> 直接指定个体间应保持的相对量，分两种：位置型（leader-follower，跟随者维持相对领导者的固定偏移）实现简单但领导者是单点故障；位移/距离型（每对邻居维持指定相对位移或距离）完全去中心化、无特殊个体，但要保证刚性（rigidity）——通信图必须「刚」到足以唯一确定形状，否则阵型会软塌或旋转漂移。刚性理论恰是 <a href=\"../coordination/distributed-coordination\">分布式协调机制</a> 图论工具在几何上的延伸。</p>\n<p><strong>虚拟结构</strong> 把整个阵型当成一个刚体，每台机器人是刚体上的一个点；先协调出刚体的整体位姿（位置+朝向），个体再各自跟踪自己在刚体上的点。它能产生最精确的队形、易于整体平移旋转，代价是需要对「虚拟刚体在哪」达成 <a href=\"../coordination/communication-consensus\">通信与共识</a>，通信与协调开销更高。无人机灯光秀多用这一范式，其工程实现见 <a href=\"../applications/drone-swarms\">无人机集群</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编队范式</th>\n<th>去中心化</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>单点故障</th>\n<th>主要弱点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人工势场</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>局部极小值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leader-follower</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>有（领导者）</td>\n<td>误差沿链累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位移/距离约束</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需满足刚性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟结构</td>\n<td>需共识</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>协调开销大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>聚集与编队是群体几何控制的两端：聚集只求靠拢（无位置约束、极鲁棒），编队求精确形状（强位置约束）。</li>\n<li>聚集是一切复杂集体行为的前置步，靠「远吸近斥」平衡稳定在有限密度，是正反馈的最干净体现；极简机器人可用 BEECLUST 类概率状态机实现。</li>\n<li>编队三范式：人工势场（轻、去中心、但有局部极小）、约束型（leader-follower 简单但单点故障，位移/距离去中心但需刚性）、虚拟结构（最精确但需共识）。</li>\n<li>「吸引-排斥」二象性、刚性、共识分别把本章与图论骨架、协调章串在一起。</li>\n<li>范式选择是去中心化程度、精度与协调开销之间的权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"聚集与编队","id":"聚集与编队"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从无序到有形的两个层级","id":"核心概念-从无序到有形的两个层级"},{"level":2,"text":"聚集：最朴素的吸引规则","id":"聚集-最朴素的吸引规则"},{"level":2,"text":"编队范式一：人工势场","id":"编队范式一-人工势场"},{"level":2,"text":"编队范式二与三：位置约束与虚拟结构","id":"编队范式二与三-位置约束与虚拟结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/coordination/task-allocation"},"next":{"title":"觅食与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/foraging-search"}}